So owning a home is a lot more expensive at one kind of period where you have to just pay in and you have maybe a mortgage.

53
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:42,260
But leasing is just a monthly fee, like you said.

54
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:45,660
So in this case, they had to leave because their lease was expired.

55
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:46,520
Exactly.

56
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,960
So you can, at the end of a lease, do one of two things.

57
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:54,510
You can stop and you can find a new apartment or you can renew your lease.

58
00:02:54,830 --> 00:02:55,030
All right.

59
00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:56,050
And that's our next word.

60
00:02:56,510 --> 00:02:58,690
To renew your lease basically means to?

61
