76
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,870
So you're living in a new place.

77
00:03:45,090 --> 00:03:48,790
So in this case, this person is going to live with the parents.

78
00:03:49,230 --> 00:03:49,670
Move in.

79
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:51,320
All right.

80
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:55,130
