84
00:04:04,810 --> 00:04:07,710
But you can also pack a suitcase or you can pack luggage.

85
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:11,840
So packing is putting things into something so that you can move them.

86
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:13,470
So you can carry them or take them somewhere.

87
00:04:13,670 --> 00:04:13,890
Exactly.

88
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:18,430
So in this case, you have to pack your things, put them in boxes to take them to your new home.

89
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:22,240
